<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>每日迷思 - 沙雕园</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D/</link><description>欢迎来到沙雕园。本博客要素较多，包括但不限于数学、编程、游戏、吐槽、冲塔、科普、整活。</description><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>#每日迷思 #蹲坑沉思 通常认为开空调时开窗更费电，因为冷气跑了…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114648648551359148/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114648648551359148/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 通常认为开空调时开窗更费电，因为冷气跑了，但这并不一定正确。以下是一反例：&lt;br>房间温度为a，外界温度为b，空调温度设为c，若a&amp;gt;c&amp;gt;b，则开窗反而有利于降低室内温度 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/4d5143941690f7df78d3.png" alt=":psyduck:" title=":psyduck:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#蹲坑沉思 #每日迷思 有一些复姓儿的第一个字儿也是姓儿。比如夏…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-113026057243122482/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-113026057243122482/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 有一些复姓儿的第一个字儿也是姓儿。比如夏侯儿惇，该如何判断此人姓夏名猴儿蹲还是姓夏侯儿名蹲？ &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/4d5143941690f7df78d3.png" alt=":psyduck:" title=":psyduck:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#每日暴论 #蹲坑沉思 #每日迷思 “虚岁儿”存在的意义是什么！…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112675227655261559/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112675227655261559/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E6%9A%B4%E8%AE%BA" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日暴论&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> “虚岁儿”存在的意义是什么！周岁可以表示一个人儿存活的时间，虚岁儿有什么实际意义！虚岁为n表示这个人经历过n-1个春节？ 😨&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112675227655261559/image-2babed3803897d62.jpg">&lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112675227655261559/image-2babed3803897d62.jpg" alt="配图 1" loading="lazy">&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#蹲坑沉思 #每日迷思 为什么全世界的微波炉结束的时候都会“叮儿…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112653625112725066/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112653625112725066/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 为什么全世界的微波炉结束的时候都会“叮儿~”一声儿呢&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#蹲坑沉思 #每日迷思 沙漠很缺水，但“沙漠”这俩字儿都是三点儿…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112649866391790458/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112649866391790458/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 沙漠很缺水，但“沙漠”这俩字儿都是三点儿水儿旁儿的 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/4d5143941690f7df78d3.png" alt=":psyduck:" title=":psyduck:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#蹲坑沉思 #每日迷思 为什么音译外来语的时候儿，r总是被音译成…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112625149371821025/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112625149371821025/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 为什么音译外来语的时候儿，r总是被音译成l呢 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 比如Robert明明听起来更像肉博尔特，却翻译成罗伯特 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#每日迷思 #蹲坑沉思 为什么0点是一天结束的界限？明儿明儿熬夜…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112582113863734357/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112582113863734357/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 为什么0点是一天结束的界限？明儿明儿熬夜过0点是很常见的行为！而且凌晨的时候习惯上也会把前一天称为“今天”！从行秋运行的规律看，6点更合理！太阳从地平线儿上升起来，新的一天开屎！&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#每日迷思 都说受伤了要尽快用水冲洗伤口，然而人们又说伤口不要碰…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112491176463791677/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112491176463791677/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 都说受伤了要尽快用水冲洗伤口，然而人们又说伤口不要碰水，甚至洗澡儿都要避开伤口 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 那伤口到底该不该接触水呢&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#蹲坑沉思 #每日迷思 为什么人们过生日通常是以“日”为单位？我…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112298417113481617/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112298417113481617/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 为什么人们过生日通常是以“日”为单位？我觉得应该把格局打开，可以根据自己喜好过“生月”、“生周”、“生时”！ &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/68996c9cf4c6db7d8438.png" alt=":doge_a1:" title=":doge_a1:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#蹲坑沉思 #每日迷思 人究竟为什么要叠被子 自古以来就有叠被子…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-111882604979287032/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-111882604979287032/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 人究竟为什么要叠被子 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/4d5143941690f7df78d3.png" alt=":psyduck:" title=":psyduck:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 自古以来就有叠被子的传统，但这事有什么实际作用呢&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#蹲坑沉思 #每日迷思 吃一口食物，嚼嚼嚼，咽下去，很正常。吃一…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-111725854853805379/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-111725854853805379/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 吃一口食物，嚼嚼嚼，咽下去，很正常。吃一口食物，嚼嚼嚼，吐出来，吃进去，咽下去，就感觉很恶心。&lt;br>明明是两坨一样的东西，为什么会变成这样呢？ &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/630adb3280013865f421.png" alt=":tv50:" title=":tv50:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#蹲坑沉思 #每日迷思 #生活妙招 #好喝的 今天在巨酸的柠檬汁…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-111671075865738235/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-111671075865738235/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E8%B9%B2%E5%9D%91%E6%B2%89%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>蹲坑沉思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%B7%E6%80%9D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日迷思&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E5%A6%99%E6%8B%9B" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>生活妙招&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E5%A5%BD%E5%96%9D%E7%9A%84" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>好喝的&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 今天在巨酸的柠檬汁儿里加了一些小苏打，酸味下降了，并且还有了一点儿汽水儿的感觉。于是有了自制汽水的想法。以下是一些可能的方案 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/68996c9cf4c6db7d8438.png" alt=":doge_a1:" title=":doge_a1:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> （未经过尝试）：&lt;/p>&lt;p>版本1：柠檬酸+小苏打&lt;br>版本2：柠檬酸+小苏打+碳酸氢钾，用一部分碳酸氢钾替代碳酸氢钠，可以防止钠摄入过多。不过比例和用量要掌握好，钾过量更危（&lt;br>版本3：柠檬酸+碳酸钙，产生二氧化碳的同时还能补钙！许多钙片的成分就是碳酸钙和柠檬酸钙！但柠檬酸比较弱，不知能否快速反应产生足够气泡，需要做实验 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> &lt;br>版本4（纯整活，请勿尝试）：盐酸+任何碳酸盐，反正胃里也有盐酸（大误）&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>